<p id="A3.p4.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p4.5.1" class="ltx_text">where <math id="A3.p4.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> is a constant that is not dependent on <math id="A3.p4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bm{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝜽</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bm{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>.
<br class="ltx_break">We carry out a similar simplification for the multiplicative denoising score-matching loss:</span></p>
<table id="A3.EGx20" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_eqnarray ltx_eqn_table">

