\bm{X}_{t}\sim p_{\bm{X}_{t}\mid\bm{X}_{0}}\end{subarray}}{{\mathbb{E}}}\left[\frac{1}{2}\Big\|\bm{X}_{t}\circ\nabla\log p_{\bm{X}_{t}|\bm{X}_{0}}(\bm{X}_{t}|\bm{X}_{0})\Big\|_{2}^{2}\right]}+\underset{\begin{subarray}{c}\bm{X}_{0}\sim p_{\bm{X}_{0}}\\
